WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 2a23c8bcc4af2ee7d5bd8d5613681427

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
Karibu tena. Natumaini kutumia mashine

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:07.160
sasa kunakuwia rahisi. Hadi sasa, kwa

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.140
aina zote za mashine ulizotumia,

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.160
move, turnLeft, shoot, zote zimefanya

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.260
jambo lilelile kila mara. Kila mara

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.520
unapoita move, mhusika wako anasogea. Kila mara

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.010
unapoita shoot, mhusika wako anapiga risasi. Hata hivyo, kimoja cha

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.560
mambo yenye nguvu zaidi kuhusu mashine, kuhusu vitendakazi, ni

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.520
kwamba nyingi zao zinakuruhusu kuweka taarifa

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.810
fulani ndani yao, na unapoziendesha,

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.380
taarifa hizo hubadilisha kile zinachofanya. Hebu tuangalie

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:38.420
mfano. Hadi sasa, tumeona mashine zinazofanana

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:40.480
kidogo, kidogo tu na masanduku, kama

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:43.360
hii ya move. Lakini mashine zingine zina

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:47.200
matundu, kama hii mashine ya walk. Mashine ya walk

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.260
ni kama ile ya move tu. Inasogeza

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.780
mhusika mbele, isipokuwa Jiki anaweza kutumia

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.320
tundu hilo kubainisha ni hatua ngapi mhusika wako

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.340
anapaswa kutembea mbele. Kwa hivyo, badala ya

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.120
kutumia kitendakazi cha move mara tatu

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.920
mfululizo, move, move, move, sasa unaweza

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.620
kutumia kitendakazi cha walk tu na kumwambia Jiki

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.200
aweke namba tatu kwenye mashine.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.320
Sasa, kufanya hivi kwenye msimbo, bado

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.260
tunaandika jina la kitendakazi, kwa hapa

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:19.920
walk, na bado tunaweka mabano yetu

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:23.740
ya kufungua. Lakini kisha, kabla ya mabano ya kufunga,

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:25.920
tunasema tunataka ingizo (<i>input</i> kwa Kiingereza) liwe nini.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.690
Kwa hivyo hapa, tunataka ingizo

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.920
liwe tatu, kumaanisha walk hatua tatu

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:34.240
mbele. Jiki anapoona hivyo, atachukua

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.930
namba tatu, na unaweza kuifikiria namba

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.310
hiyo kama sarafu ndogo, naye

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.300
ataiweka kwenye tundu la ingizo la

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.200
mashine kabla ya kuzungusha mpini

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.660
kuiwasha. Baada ya muda mfupi, utafanya

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:49.660
mazoezi ambapo utachora mistatili na

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.000
miduara. Kwa vitendakazi hivyo, unahitaji kumwambia

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.110
Jiki aingize namba kadhaa tofauti, akibainisha mambo

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.380
kama umbali wake kutoka kushoto,

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:00.840
umbali wake kutoka juu,

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.160
upana wa mstatili, na

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:07.140
urefu wa mstatili. Katika ulimwengu wa Jiki, hizo

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.120
ni matundu tofauti tu, moja kwa kila

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.880
namba. Kwa hivyo kwenye msimbo wetu,

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.120
tunaandika kila namba tu kisha kuweka koma

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:18.460
katikati. Jina la kitendakazi,

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:20.980
bano la kufungua, namba kwa kila ingizo,

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.180
zote zikitenganishwa na koma, na kisha tunafunga

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:27.380
mabano yetu. Ukijaribu kutumia

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.810
kitendakazi chenye idadi isiyo sahihi ya ingizo,

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.620
utapata hitilafu. Kwa mfano,

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.660
ukijaribu kuweka ingizo moja kwenye

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.080
mashine isiyo na tundu, Jiki

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.060
atakuambia huwezi. Na

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.640
ukijaribu kutumia mashine iliyo na

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.840
tundu la ingizo, lakini usimwambie Jiki

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.920
aweke nini ndani yake, naye pia atasimama na

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.960
kulalamika. Jaribu ikiwa unajisikia

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.380
mwasi kidogo, uone kitakachotokea. Utafanya

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.370
makosa mengi kama haya kadiri mambo

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.940
yanavyozidi kuwa magumu. Jaribu usipate msongo wa mawazo

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.170
wala usikasirike kwa sababu ya hilo. Sote tunajifunza kwa

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:00.080
kufanya makosa. Kwa kweli ni njia ya haraka zaidi kwa

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.600
akili zetu kuyaelewa mambo kwa dhati. Na kila mtu

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.320
hufanya makosa haya. Sote tulianza kutoka sifuri,

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.340
kwa hivyo usipate msongo. Kabla hujaanza,

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.910
kuna jambo lingine linalofaa kutajwa.

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.400
Wakati mwingine kwenye mazoezi haya, utaona

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.660
mistari inayoanza na mikwaju miwili. Sasa, hii

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:23.040
inaitwa maoni (<i>comment</i> kwa Kiingereza). Ni madokezo ya faragha kwa ajili

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.420
yako mwenyewe ambayo Jiki atayapuuza kabisa. Kwa hivyo

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.500
Jiki akiona mstari unaoanza na

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.130
mikwaju hii miwili, ataupita tu, na

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.670
ataendelea hadi mstari

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.320
unaofuata. Maoni haya yanakupa njia ya

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.650
kuandika madokezo yako mwenyewe. Ni

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.800
muhimu sana kwa kukukumbusha jinsi mambo yanavyofanya kazi.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.430
Mara nyingi, mimi huandika maoni kwa ajili yako pia,

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.630
ili unapoanza zoezi,

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.120
yanaweza kukudokeza mahali unapaswa kuandika msimbo

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.109
au jinsi ya kutatua jambo fulani. Lakini

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.880
jisikie huru

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:55.480
kuongeza maoni yako mwenyewe pia. Kadiri

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:58.310
unavyoendelea, angalia chini ya maelekezo,

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.980
na utaona taarifa kuhusu vitendakazi

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.280
unavyoweza kutumia, na ingizo kamili

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.520
ambazo unahitaji kuweka. Furahia

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.020
kujaribu ingizo hizo, na tutaonana

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:07.740
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
